<title>USA: USDA to donate 8,000 tonnes soybean meal to Russia.</title>
<headline>USDA to donate 8,000 tonnes soybean meal to Russia.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said it will donate about 8,000 tonnes of soybean meal to Feed the Children of Larry Jones International Ministries Inc, a private charity, for monetization in Russia.</p>
<p>USDA said the donation will be made under its Food for Progress program. The supply period is fiscal year 1997.</p>
